SUMMARY:Envisioning the New Year with Creativity & Vision Board-Making
DESCRIPTION:Envisioning the New Year with Creativity & Vision Board-Making\nwith Catherine Willows \nThursday\, January 7  |  12 – 4 pm \nRegister Here!\nA new year opens like a blank canvas\, inviting us to awaken our imagination and explore what we wish to create\, experience\, and welcome into our lives. The first New Moon following Winter Solstice offers a beautiful moment for renewal\, fresh perspective\, and envisioning new possibilities. As the returning light begins to illuminate the winter landscape\, we\, too\, can begin to see what is ready to emerge. Gathering at the Arboretum\, we’ll connect with the rhythms of Nature and the Creative Life Force through guided reflection and intuitive art-making. Beyond traditional goal-setting or vision boarding\, this is an invitation to open a creative portal into the possibilities of a new cycle. Through collage\, painting\, color\, imagery\, symbols\, and words\, you’ll create a personal vision board expressing the inspiration and possibilities drawing you forward. No art experience is needed—just curiosity\, an open heart\, and a willingness to explore. \nArt supplies will be provided. Please bring magazines or images to cut and paste\, along with a journal. \nCatherine Willows is a Registered Nurse\, Certified Functional Medicine Health Coach\, and Transformational Creativity Coach\, and founder of Willows Coaching and Consulting. While holding sacred space\, she guides adults in awakening their inner creativity — moving beyond the demands of daily life into greater flow\, self-discovery\, and joy through intuitive art-making processes. \nCatherine believes creativity and our connection to the natural world are deeply interwoven — both vital pillars of wellbeing\, supporting nervous system regulation and inner equanimity\, and together essential for living a meaningful\, embodied life aligned with purpose and authentic expression. \n●  Pre-registration is required for all classes unless otherwise detailed above. \n●  Members: Remember to enter your promo code upon checkout to receive your 10% member discount! Email adulteducation@ncarboretum.org with questions. \n●  See a full listing of Adult Education Programs at the North Carolina Arboretum here! Questions? Check our FAQs. \n●  We are committed to fostering a diverse\, supportive learning community. If the cost of a class is a barrier for you\, please complete this scholarship form and we will see what kind of assistance we can provide. \n●  Follow us on Facebook & Instagram! Or join our Adult Education Student Hub on Discord! \n●  Interested in supporting the NC Arboretum more directly? Donate to the ONE Fund here. \nSee all of our classes open for registration here!
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/vision-board-workshop/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education
